## Quick Reference

- **Language/Framework:** PHP 8.3, WordPress 6.x{{#if SCSS_ENABLED}}, SCSS + Gulp 4 (Dart Sass){{/if}}, vanilla JS
- **Package manager:** npm (per-theme build), no Composer on server
- **Database:** MariaDB 10.11
- **Local stack:** Docker Compose — WP ({{WP_PORT}}), phpMyAdmin ({{PHPMYADMIN_PORT}}), MariaDB ({{DB_PORT}})
{{#if FTP_ENABLED}}- **Deploy:** `lftp` over FTPS via `scripts/deploy-ftp.sh`
{{/if}}

## Build & Run

Local:
```bash
cp .env.example .env
docker compose up -d
./scripts/seed-db.sh
open http://{{HOSTNAME}}:{{WP_PORT}}
```

{{#if SCSS_ENABLED}}Theme assets (SCSS + JS):
```bash
cd wp-content/themes/{{THEME_SLUG}}
npm install                       # first time
npm run build                     # one-off compile
npm run watch                     # dev mode with BrowserSync
```
{{/if}}

{{#if DEEPL_ENABLED}}Translations (DeepL-powered):
```bash
docker compose exec wordpress wp i18n make-pot \
  /var/www/html/wp-content/themes/{{THEME_SLUG}} \
  /var/www/html/wp-content/themes/{{THEME_SLUG}}/languages/{{THEME_SLUG}}.pot \
  --domain={{THEME_SLUG}} --allow-root
node scripts/translate-po.mjs
```
{{/if}}

{{#if FTP_ENABLED}}Deploy to staging:
```bash
./scripts/deploy-ftp.sh           # reads .env.deploy (gitignored)
```
{{/if}}

## Key Commands

- `./scripts/seed-db.sh`           — fresh-install bootstrap (core + plugins + theme)
{{#if DEEPL_ENABLED}}- `./scripts/translate-po.mjs`     — DeepL batch translator for theme strings
{{/if}}{{#if FTP_ENABLED}}- `./scripts/deploy-ftp.sh`        — FTPS mirror of the theme{{#if CUSTOM_PLUGIN}} + custom plugins{{/if}}
- `./scripts/test-ftp.sh`          — dry-run: verify FTP credentials
{{/if}}

## Architecture

```
{{PROJECT_SLUG}}/                          # WordPress root
├── docker-compose.yml                     # local stack
├── scripts/                               # bootstrap{{#if FTP_ENABLED}}, deploy{{/if}}{{#if DEEPL_ENABLED}}, translate{{/if}}
├── docs/                                  # local-dev, plugins{{#if FTP_ENABLED}}, deployment{{/if}}{{#if DEEPL_ENABLED}}, translations{{/if}}
└── wp-content/
    ├── themes/{{THEME_SLUG}}/{{#if SCSS_ENABLED}}
    │   ├── sass/                          # 7-1 SCSS structure
    │   ├── dist/main.css                  # compiled (tracked — needed for FTP deploy){{/if}}
    │   ├── includes/                      # cleanup, enqueue, seo, icons{{#if MULTI_LANG}}, polylang-config{{/if}}
    │   ├── template-parts/                # site-nav, hero{{#if MULTI_LANG}}, language-switcher{{/if}}
    │   ├── page-templates/                # add page templates here
    │   └── languages/                     # .pot, .po, .mo per language{{#if CUSTOM_PLUGIN}}
    └── plugins/
        └── {{PLUGIN_SLUG}}/                # custom plugin{{else}}
{{/if}}
```

## Workflow

- **Branches:** work on dedicated branches; never directly on `main`.
- **Commits:** logical batches per subsystem. Use conventional-style prefixes (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `chore:`, `style:`{{#if MULTI_LANG}}, `i18n:`{{/if}}, `assets:`).
- **Do NOT** paste API keys or secrets into committed files. Use `.env` (dev) or `wp-config.php` defines (prod, server-only).
{{#if FTP_ENABLED}}- **Testing flow:** localhost first (`docker compose up -d`) → staging (`./scripts/deploy-ftp.sh`) → production.
{{/if}}

## Key files to know

- `wp-content/themes/{{THEME_SLUG}}/functions.php` — theme bootstrap, includes loader
- `wp-content/themes/{{THEME_SLUG}}/includes/enqueue.php` — CSS/JS enqueue
{{#if MULTI_LANG}}- `wp-content/themes/{{THEME_SLUG}}/includes/polylang-config.php` — language helpers (`{{PREFIX}}_page_url()`, `{{PREFIX}}_current_language()`)
{{/if}}{{#if SCSS_ENABLED}}- `wp-content/themes/{{THEME_SLUG}}/sass/abstracts/_variables.scss` — design tokens
